	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a rune</p><hr><p>This spiraling diacritic channels the magic of a rune outwards, then back to the same location, allowing a rune to reconstitute itself. After the base rune is invoked, the rune automatically Traces itself back upon the same target.</p><hr><p><strong>Special</strong> You can have only one copy of <em>sun-, diacritic rune of preservation</em> applied at a given time, and once you invoke it, you cannot Etch or Trace it again for 10 minutes.</p>"
